# Landry & Swarr, LLC

> New Orleans law firm representing people across Louisiana harmed by asbestos, talcum powder, benzene and other toxic exposures. Mesothelioma has been the center of the firm's practice since {{ site.since }}. Office: {{ site.address.street }}, {{ site.address.city }}, {{ site.address.region }} {{ site.address.zip }}. Phone: {{ site.phone }}. Se habla español.

Landry & Swarr represents individuals and families in Louisiana state and federal courts in mesothelioma, asbestos lung cancer, secondary (family) asbestos exposure, talcum powder, benzene (AML, MDS, leukemia, lymphoma) and other toxic chemical cases. The firm also serves as Louisiana local counsel for out-of-state firms. Attorneys: Mickey P. Landry, Frank J. Swarr, Matthew C. Clark and Ben Rumph. Consultations are free.

